{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":113,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਉਸਤਤ ਦੇ ਯੋਗ ਨਾਮ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਹਲਲੂਯਾਹ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੇ ਸੇਵਕੋ, ਉਸਤਤ ਕਰੋ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਕਰੋ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਮੁਬਾਰਕ ਹੋਵੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੁਣ ਤੋਂ ਲੈ ਕੇ ਸਦੀਪਕ ਕਾਲ ਤੱਕ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸੂਰਜ ਦੇ ਚੜਨ ਤੋਂ ਉਹ ਦੇ ਲਹਿਣ ਤੱਕ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਉਸਤਤ ਹੋਵੇ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਸਭ ਕੌਮਾਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਮਹਾਨ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਦੀ ਮਹਿਮਾ ਅਕਾਸ਼ਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਵੀ ਉੱਪਰ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕੌਣ ਸਾਡੇ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੇ ਤੁੱਲ ਹੈ?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਉਚਿਆਈ ਤੇ ਵੱਸਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਨੂੰ ਨੀਵਿਆਂ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਅਕਾਸ਼ ਅਤੇ ਧਰਤੀ ਉੱਤੇ ਨਿਗਾਹ ਮਾਰੇ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਗਰੀਬ ਨੂੰ ਖਾਕ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਚੁੱਕਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਕੰਗਾਲ ਨੂੰ ਰੂੜੀ ਤੋਂ ਉਠਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਉਹ ਨੂੰ ਪਤਵੰਤਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸਗੋਂ ਉਹ ਦੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਲੋਕਾਂ ਦੇ ਪਤਵੰਤਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਬਿਠਾਵੇ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਬੇ-ਔਲਾਦ ਔਰਤ ਦਾ ਘਰ ਵਸਾਉਂਦਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਬੱਚਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਮਾਂ ਬਣਾ ਕੇ ਉਹ ਨੂੰ ਅਨੰਦ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹਲਲੂਯਾਹ!।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/113.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/114.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/112.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}